Package: usb4-nvme-direct-boot
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), coreutils, util-linux, pciutils
Recommends: dracut | initramfs-tools, grub2-common
Maintainer: StickwoodJr <dev@stickwoodjr.local>
Description: USB4/Thunderbolt 4 NVMe Direct-Boot Hardening Suite
 Workaround suite and tooling to prevent pre-boot PCIe tunnel teardown
 and dropped external NVMe root filesystems on Linux kernels >= 6.8.
 Implements runtime gating, early rescan hooks, and transactional safety.
